flowchart TD
    E[Focused E first physics hit] --> Context[Actual Table or current site]
    Context --> Draft[Existing contextual menu and draft selections]
    Draft --> Confirm[Explicit Confirm]
    Confirm --> Validate[Validate entire quote current owner capacity and balance]
    Validate -->|reject| Draft
    Validate -->|accept once| Commit[Debit once reserve goods passengers and convoy members]
    Commit --> Spawn[Create actual supplier carriers at south road entry]
    Spawn --> Approach[Spaced physical approach and shared berth queue]
    Approach --> Unload[Four real workers carry freight or purchased people disembark]
    Unload --> Depart[Actual complete handover starts eastward departure]
    Depart --> Members[Remove only that convoy member]
    Members -->|members remain| Locked[Ordering disabled with reason]
    Members -->|last member| Ready[Emit ready event enable next order]
    Depart --> Exit[Physical empty egress and supplier completion]
    Build[Choose building] --> Camera[Overhead orthographic camera and static one metre grid]
    Camera --> Snap[Snap actual rotated footprint edges and preview]
    Snap --> Place[Confirm current draft once through existing validation]
    Place -->|invalid| Snap
    Place -->|valid| Site[Actual site and existing Build controls]
    Camera -->|cancel| Return[Restore character camera with same manager pose]
